{"steam_appid":2542020,"steam_name":"Duskfade","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2542020/489975441/8fef813b6c89f9cbce09a886ce8adb748d40d223/1786614416/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786625449","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257398079/2ce234a8306d85a0cdf835775dfc29118aa28892/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786625449","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/258e28424b24c31f56bcdf8b6ad82a2f5a7dea97/ss_258e28424b24c31f56bcdf8b6ad82a2f5a7dea97.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786631734","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/328b3694246a77b724699f9332b26c1b14709d47/ss_328b3694246a77b724699f9332b26c1b14709d47.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786631734","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/3e39047dde42bb6f20487eb35f1439fa87e1a473/ss_3e39047dde42bb6f20487eb35f1439fa87e1a473.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786631734","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/6340e067b5e52f4e07eab66995e0ec387e861800/ss_6340e067b5e52f4e07eab66995e0ec387e861800.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786631734","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/f03315b668f4e48bb09d3b5668308c875a851524/ss_f03315b668f4e48bb09d3b5668308c875a851524.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786631734"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong><i>Zirian</i></strong> save his sister from the claws of Despair by restoring the fabric of time and uncovering the secrets of the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/6a87989cac621a10655c2fcb7a97dbe1.poster.avif?t=1786631734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/6a87989cac621a10655c2fcb7a97dbe1.webm?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/6a87989cac621a10655c2fcb7a97dbe1.mp4?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a seamless blend of <i>dynamic platforming and fast-paced combat</i>. Jump, dash, grapple, and glide your way through thrilling challenges that rekindle the magic of classic action platformer favourites. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f5b20c0a4328fded43892ffd6842c229.poster.avif?t=1786631734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f5b20c0a4328fded43892ffd6842c229.webm?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/f5b20c0a4328fded43892ffd6842c229.mp4?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning realms shaped by the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>, each f<i>illed with mystery, magic, breathtaking vistas</i>, and endearing characters. Navigate ethereal forests, underwater realms, sunlit dunes and cloudy heights - the world of <strong><i>Duskfade</i></strong> is alive and teems with secrets for you to uncover.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/55ce6d9085f228e03c06d7997858d4ab.poster.avif?t=1786631734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/55ce6d9085f228e03c06d7997858d4ab.webm?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/55ce6d9085f228e03c06d7997858d4ab.mp4?t=1786631734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience a powerful coming-of-age journey filled with heart</i>, loss, and the courage to face the unknown. Join a cast of charming characters to face down long forgotten foes, each embodying an emotional hurdle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 64-bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen5 1500X or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX1050Ti 4GB or AMD RX580 4GB or Higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64 bit Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-9700 or AMD Ryzen5 2600X or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX2060 8GB or AMD 5700 8GB or Higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"developers":["Weird Beluga"],"publishers":["Fireshine Games"],"release_date":"Aug 13, 2026"}